{
  "info": {
    "name": "KADA - Selling Module",
    "description": "Endpoint untuk pencatatan penjualan menu dari Production Plan yang sedang active. Hanya membaca ProductionPlan, hanya menulis PlanSale + menus[].soldQuantity/soldOutAt. Path dikoreksi supaya match selling.routes.js yang sebenarnya (GET /active, POST /, GET /history -- BUKAN /plans, /sales, /sales/history). cashierName TIDAK dikirim di body -- diambil server-side dari req.user.name (Authorization Bearer token).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "kada-selling-module-002"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{authToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000/api", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "authToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "planId", "value": "665f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "menuId", "value": "665f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c1a", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Get Active Plans (B1)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/selling/active",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["selling", "active"]
        },
        "description": "Mengambil semua Production Plan berstatus active, lengkap dengan sisa stok dan harga berlaku (termasuk diskon) per menu. Melakukan lazy-complete untuk plan yang endDate-nya sudah lewat. name diambil dari frozenMenuName (dibekukan saat approve), bukan live-join ke Menu."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Setiap menu punya name terisi (bukan null)', function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    jsonData.data.forEach(function (plan) {",
              "        plan.menus.forEach(function (m) {",
              "            pm.expect(m.name, 'name harus terisi -- kalau null, plan ini di-approve SEBELUM frozenMenuName patch, lihat catatan backfill').to.not.be.null;",
              "        });",
              "    });",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "200 OK - Daftar plan aktif",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/selling/active",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["selling", "active"]
            }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Daftar plan aktif berhasil diambil\",\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"planId\": \"665f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d\",\n      \"name\": \"Plan Weekday Pagi - Minggu 32\",\n      \"startDate\": \"2026-08-04T00:00:00.000Z\",\n      \"endDate\": \"2026-08-10T23:59:59.000Z\",\n      \"sellable\": true,\n      \"menus\": [\n        {\n          \"menuId\": \"665f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c1a\",\n          \"name\": \"Cappuccino Regular\",\n          \"sellingPrice\": 25000,\n          \"currentPrice\": 20000,\n          \"isDiscounted\": true,\n          \"discountPercentage\": 20,\n          \"discountEndsAt\": \"2026-08-10T23:59:59.000Z\",\n          \"remainingQuantity\": 34\n        }\n      ],\n      \"warning\": null\n    }\n  ]\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Create Sale (B2)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"planId\": \"{{planId}}\",\n  \"menuId\": \"{{menuId}}\",\n  \"quantitySold\": 2\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/selling",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["selling"]
        },
        "description": "Mencatat satu transaksi penjualan menu dari plan yang sedang active. cashierName SENGAJA TIDAK ADA di body -- diambil controller dari req.user.name (Authorization Bearer token yang lo pakai di collection ini). Validasi window waktu, sisa stok (atomic guard $expr top-level), hitung harga (frozenSellingPrice + diskon jika aktif), decrement stok, dan insert PlanSale terjadi dalam satu transaction."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "201 Created - Penjualan berhasil dicatat",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"planId\": \"{{planId}}\",\n  \"menuId\": \"{{menuId}}\",\n  \"quantitySold\": 2\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/selling",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["selling"]
            }
          },
          "status": "Created",
          "code": 201,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Penjualan berhasil dicatat\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"_id\": \"665f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c2e\",\n    \"planId\": \"665f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d\",\n    \"menuId\": \"665f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c1a\",\n    \"menuName\": \"Cappuccino Regular\",\n    \"quantitySold\": 2,\n    \"originalPrice\": 25000,\n    \"priceUsed\": 20000,\n    \"discountApplied\": true,\n    \"discountPercentage\": 20,\n    \"cashierName\": \"Rina\",\n    \"soldAt\": \"2026-08-09T04:12:33.000Z\",\n    \"remainingQuantity\": 32\n  }\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "409 Conflict - Sisa porsi tidak mencukupi",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"planId\": \"{{planId}}\",\n  \"menuId\": \"{{menuId}}\",\n  \"quantitySold\": 999\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/selling",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["selling"]
            }
          },
          "status": "Conflict",
          "code": 409,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"message\": \"Sisa porsi menu ini tidak mencukupi\",\n  \"details\": [\n    { \"field\": \"quantitySold\", \"message\": \"Sisa 1, diminta 999\" }\n  ]\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "404 Not Found - Plan tidak active",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"planId\": \"000000000000000000000000\",\n  \"menuId\": \"{{menuId}}\",\n  \"quantitySold\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/selling",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["selling"]
            }
          },
          "status": "Not Found",
          "code": 404,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"message\": \"Plan tidak ditemukan atau bukan berstatus active\"\n}"
        }
      ],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 201', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('menuName ikut tersimpan (frozen snapshot)', function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.menuName).to.not.be.null;",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('cashierName otomatis terisi dari req.user, bukan dari body', function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.cashierName).to.not.be.empty;",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Get Sale History (B3)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/selling/history?planId={{planId}}&date=2026-08-09&cashierName=Rina",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["selling", "history"],
          "query": [
            { "key": "planId", "value": "{{planId}}", "description": "Filter by plan (opsional)" },
            {
              "key": "date",
              "value": "2026-08-09",
              "description": "Filter by tanggal soldAt, format YYYY-MM-DD (opsional)"
            },
            {
              "key": "cashierName",
              "value": "Rina",
              "description": "Filter by nama kasir (opsional)"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Mengambil riwayat transaksi penjualan untuk rekonsiliasi shift, dengan ringkasan totalTransaction, totalRevenue, dan totalDiscountGiven (dihitung di response time). menuName sudah snapshot per PlanSale, tidak live-join ke Menu."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Summary punya 3 field agregat', function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.summary).to.have.property('totalTransaction');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.summary).to.have.property('totalRevenue');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.summary).to.have.property('totalDiscountGiven');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "200 OK - Riwayat penjualan",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/selling/history?planId={{planId}}&date=2026-08-09&cashierName=Rina",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["selling", "history"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "planId", "value": "{{planId}}" },
                { "key": "date", "value": "2026-08-09" },
                { "key": "cashierName", "value": "Rina" }
              ]
            }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Riwayat penjualan berhasil diambil\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"data\": [\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"665f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c2e\",\n        \"menuId\": \"665f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c1a\",\n        \"menuName\": \"Cappuccino Regular\",\n        \"quantitySold\": 2,\n        \"originalPrice\": 25000,\n        \"priceUsed\": 20000,\n        \"discountApplied\": true,\n        \"discountPercentage\": 20,\n        \"cashierName\": \"Rina\",\n        \"soldAt\": \"2026-08-09T04:12:33.000Z\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"summary\": {\n      \"totalTransaction\": 1,\n      \"totalRevenue\": 40000,\n      \"totalDiscountGiven\": 10000\n    }\n  }\n}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
